    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {"@context":"http://schema.org","@graph":[{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-07-02T18:58:01.122Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_paypal-is-proud-to-join-the-european-payments-activity-7478522386380640256-lTOp","text":"PayPal is proud to join the European Payments Council (EPC). \n\nAs digital commerce continues to evolve, collaboration across the payments ecosystem has never been more important. European Payments Council membership reflects PayPal's commitment to advancing innovation, interoperability, trust, and resilience across the European payments landscape. \n\nIn a new interview with the European Payments Council, Sean Byrne, CEO of PayPal Europe, shares perspectives on the future of payments in Europe, the growing importance of interoperability, and the opportunities that come from deeper industry collaboration. \n\nRead the full interview: https://lnkd.in/ezr3iFWu","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_paypal-is-proud-to-join-the-european-payments-activity-7478522386380640256-lTOp"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-07-01T21:08:41.290Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_this-spring-paypal-employees-volunteered-activity-7478192882559119361-e0YN","text":"​This Spring, PayPal employees volunteered as coaches and judges at the Network for Teaching Entrepreneurship (NFTE) Youth Entrepreneurship Showcase — guiding nearly 70 students through pitches spanning AI, athlete health tech, and accessible hearing solutions.​\n​\nSince 2015, PayPal has contributed $1.7 million to the NFTE and mobilized nearly 3,000 volunteers across the US to expand opportunity for the next generation.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_this-spring-paypal-employees-volunteered-activity-7478192882559119361-e0YN"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-06-25T14:50:31.077Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_were-expanding-paypals-buy-now-pay-later-activity-7475923385718378496-QsNA","text":"We're expanding PayPal's Buy Now, Pay Later (BNPL) offering in France, giving consumers more flexibility for larger purchases at checkout.​\n​\n✅ Pay in 6, 12, or 24X lets eligible customers spread the cost of larger purchases across predictable monthly installments.​\n​\n✅ Designed for higher-value purchases like travel, electronics, and home equipment, complementing our existing Pay in 4X offering.​\n​\n✅ Merchants can offer more choice at checkout while helping drive conversion and reduce cart abandonment","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_were-expanding-paypals-buy-now-pay-later-activity-7475923385718378496-QsNA"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-06-24T19:15:48.825Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_paypal-is-proud-to-join-the-the-aspen-institute-activity-7475627761731268608-qfkW","text":"PayPal is proud to join the The Aspen Institute Financial Security Program's Leadership Group on Scam Prevention.\n \nScams and fraud affect consumers, businesses, and communities around the world. Addressing these challenges requires collaboration across industries and sectors to develop practical solutions that strengthen trust and improve customer protection.\n \nWe look forward to working alongside fellow members of the Leadership Group to advance efforts that help make the digital economy safer and more secure for everyone.\n\nLearn more: https://lnkd.in/eF3fxAuA","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_paypal-is-proud-to-join-the-the-aspen-institute-activity-7475627761731268608-qfkW"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-06-22T15:42:10.061Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_were-in-cannes-this-week-bringing-together-activity-7474849220244611073-GgVn","text":"We're in Cannes this week, bringing together customers, partners and industry leaders at the PayPal Patisserie. Looking forward to a week of meaningful conversations, shared insights and deepening the relationships that matter most to our customers and business.","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_were-in-cannes-this-week-bringing-together-activity-7474849220244611073-GgVn"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-06-02T13:30:33.712Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_today-were-excited-to-help-bring-the-first-activity-7467568343206625283-hlYr","text":"Today, we’re excited to help bring the first agentic commerce platform with in-app checkout to the UK - introducing Hey Savi! Powered by PayPal, the platform makes it easier for shoppers to find, compare and buy must-have styles without ever leaving the app. \n\nConsumers increasingly discover products through screenshots, influencers, social content, and everyday inspiration, but the path to purchase is still often fragmented and time-consuming. This launch helps close that gap through AI-powered discovery, live inventory and availability, and seamless PayPal checkout. \n\nWe're excited to be part of an industry first for the UK market - another step toward creating trusted, scalable agentic commerce experiences for consumers and merchants alike.\n\nLearn more: https://bit.ly/3Qcq6D4","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_today-were-excited-to-help-bring-the-first-activity-7467568343206625283-hlYr"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-05-27T15:29:47.775Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_today-were-expanding-paypals-buy-now-pay-activity-7465424022319747074-3lco","text":"Today we’re expanding PayPal’s Buy Now, Pay Later (BNPL) offering into Austria as demand for flexible payment options continues to grow across Europe.  \n\n✅ PayPal Pay in 30 allows customers to pay eligible purchases within 30 days with automatic repayment and reminders. \n✅ PayPal Ratenzahlung enables customers to pay with flexible installments spread across 3, 6, 12, or 24 fixed payments. \n✅ Merchants experience higher checkout conversion and increased basket sizes when consumers use BNPL at checkout. \n\nLearn more: https://lnkd.in/d3GJ5VSu","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_today-were-expanding-paypals-buy-now-pay-activity-7465424022319747074-3lco"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-05-20T21:15:43.024Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_as-we-expand-pyusd-and-crypto-enabled-payments-activity-7462974361109422081-j0yH","text":"As we expand PYUSD and crypto-enabled payments worldwide, protecting customers remains just as important as the innovation itself. ​\n​\nThat’s why we’re partnering with Chainabuse, the largest free community-powered platform for reporting crypto fraud, powered by TRM Labs, to help customers proactively report suspected scams.​\n​\nWhen a user reports through Chainabuse:​\n🔹 Scam-related wallet addresses are shared with vetted law enforcement and trusted partners to help investigate cases and prevent further victimization ​\n🔹 Reports sharing the same scam patterns are automatically linked, surfacing multiple victims so investigators can build stronger, higher-impact cases​\n​\nCrypto's potential is too important to let bad actors undermine it.​\n​\nReport a scam: https://lnkd.in/ePhDuF4u","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_as-we-expand-pyusd-and-crypto-enabled-payments-activity-7462974361109422081-j0yH"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-05-13T17:15:40.706Z","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_82-of-small-businesses-say-ai-is-essential-activity-7460377238325080065-0M50","text":"82% of small businesses say AI is essential to staying competitive. 73% say they don't have the tools or training to do it.​\n​\nToday, PayPal is partnering with Anthropic and Claude to close that gap. Together, we're launching AI Fluency for Small Business — a free course built around real insights from AI researchers and small business owners like Mak Cabessa, founder and CEO of MAKS Enterprises and longtime PayPal customer.​\n​\nWe’re proud to bring this to our merchants and nonprofit partners as we work towards our goal of supporting 25 million people and small businesses with the resources, skills, and training they need to thrive in the digital economy by 2030.\n​\nThe tools reshaping the economy should be within reach for everyone. Learn more: https://lnkd.in/geGXT7Qq","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_82-of-small-businesses-say-ai-is-essential-activity-7460377238325080065-0M50"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"DiscussionForumPosting","author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal"},"datePublished":"2026-05-12T16:59:57.635Z","headline":"","mainEntityOfPage":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_were-not-just-powering-payments-were-powering-activity-7460010894975143936-GKp3","text":"We're not just powering payments. We're powering progress. 💙\n\nOur 2025 Global Impact Report is live. See how we’re using our global scale to drive real opportunity and progress for employees, communities, and the planet across 200+ markets. \n\nRead more here: https://lnkd.in/gBCKivvA","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paypal_were-not-just-powering-payments-were-powering-activity-7460010894975143936-GKp3"},{"@context":"http://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"PayPal","url":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/paypal","address":{"type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"2211 North First Street","addressLocality":"San Jose","addressRegion":"CA","postalCode":"95131","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"We're championing possibilities for all by making money fast, easy, and more enjoyable. Our hope is to unlock opportunities for people in their everyday lives and empower the millions of people and businesses around the world who trust, rely, and use PayPal every day. \n\nFor support, visit the PayPal Help Center. https://payp.al/help\n\nFor employment opportunities, check out our job openings in the 'Jobs' tab. We're an equal opportunity employer that welcomes diversity, and offer generous benefits to help you thrive at work and in your free time.\n\nNMLS#910457: https://nmlsconsumeraccess.org/","numberOfEmployees":{"value":37011,"@type":"QuantitativeValue"},"logo":{"contentUrl":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGlX0cKdGRk-w/company-logo_200_200/company-logo_200_200/0/1725506319701?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=LcQWfGe2Fgwe-TtE0X8XJ2ZQ5NjDrgr6s8CJ1gR5Vng","description":"PayPal","@type":"ImageObject"},"sameAs":"https://www.paypal.com/us/home"}]}
    </script>
  
  
      
