    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">This Spring, PayPal employees volunteered as coaches and judges at the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/network-for-teaching-entrepreneurship?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Network for Teaching Entrepreneurship (NFTE)</a> Youth Entrepreneurship Showcase — guiding nearly 70 students through pitches spanning AI, athlete health tech, and accessible hearing solutions.

Since 2015, PayPal has contributed $1.7 million to the NFTE and mobilized nearly 3,000 volunteers across the US to expand opportunity for the next generation.</p>
