  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">PayPal is proud to join the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/the-aspen-institute-financial-security-program/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Aspen Institute Financial Security Program</a>'s Leadership Group on Scam Prevention.
 
Scams and fraud affect consumers, businesses, and communities around the world. Addressing these challenges requires collaboration across industries and sectors to develop practical solutions that strengthen trust and improve customer protection.
 
We look forward to working alongside fellow members of the Leadership Group to advance efforts that help make the digital economy safer and more secure for everyone.

Learn more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eF3fxAuA?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eF3fxAuA</a></p>
