  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Today, we’re excited to help bring the first agentic commerce platform with in-app checkout to the UK - introducing Hey Savi! Powered by PayPal, the platform makes it easier for shoppers to find, compare and buy must-have styles without ever leaving the app. 

Consumers increasingly discover products through screenshots, influencers, social content, and everyday inspiration, but the path to purchase is still often fragmented and time-consuming. This launch helps close that gap through AI-powered discovery, live inventory and availability, and seamless PayPal checkout. 

We're excited to be part of an industry first for the UK market - another step toward creating trusted, scalable agentic commerce experiences for consumers and merchants alike.

Learn more: <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/3Qcq6D4?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/3Qcq6D4</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

