  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Today we’re expanding PayPal’s Buy Now, Pay Later (BNPL) offering into Austria as demand for flexible payment options continues to grow across Europe.  

✅ PayPal Pay in 30 allows customers to pay eligible purchases within 30 days with automatic repayment and reminders. 
✅ PayPal Ratenzahlung enables customers to pay with flexible installments spread across 3, 6, 12, or 24 fixed payments. 
✅ Merchants experience higher checkout conversion and increased basket sizes when consumers use BNPL at checkout. 

Learn more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/d3GJ5VSu?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/d3GJ5VSu</a></p>
<!---->  </div>



        

        
            
      
    
    
    

