  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">As we expand PYUSD and crypto-enabled payments worldwide, protecting customers remains just as important as the innovation itself. 

That’s why we’re partnering with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/chainabuse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Chainabuse</a>, the largest free community-powered platform for reporting crypto fraud, powered by <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/trmlabs?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>TRM Labs</a>, to help customers proactively report suspected scams.

When a user reports through Chainabuse:
🔹 Scam-related wallet addresses are shared with vetted law enforcement and trusted partners to help investigate cases and prevent further victimization 
🔹 Reports sharing the same scam patterns are automatically linked, surfacing multiple victims so investigators can build stronger, higher-impact cases

Crypto's potential is too important to let bad actors undermine it.

Report a scam: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ePhDuF4u?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ePhDuF4u</a></p>
          
            
                  
    

    <button class="attributed-text-segment-list__btn-truncation absolute right-0 bottom-0 pl-1 bg-color-background-container text-color-text-secondary text-sm font-medium babybear:font-bold invisible cursor-pointer hover:text-color-link-hover hover:underline" data-feed-action="see-more-post" data-feed-action-category="EXPAND" data-feed-action-type="expandCommentaryText" data-feed-control="commentary_expand" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="0">
