  <div class="attributed-text-segment-list__container relative mt-1 mb-1.5 babybear:mt-0 babybear:mb-0.5">
    <p class="attributed-text-segment-list__content text-color-text !text-sm whitespace-pre-wrap break-words
        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">82% of small businesses say AI is essential to staying competitive. 73% say they don't have the tools or training to do it.

Today, PayPal is partnering with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/anthropicresearch?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Anthropic</a> and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/claude/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Claude</a> to close that gap. Together, we're launching AI Fluency for Small Business — a free course built around real insights from AI researchers and small business owners like <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mak-cabessa-b4658315b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mak Cabessa</a>, founder and CEO of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/maks-enterprises?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>MAKS Enterprises</a> and longtime PayPal customer.

We’re proud to bring this to our merchants and nonprofit partners as we work towards our goal of supporting 25 million people and small businesses with the resources, skills, and training they need to thrive in the digital economy by 2030.

The tools reshaping the economy should be within reach for everyone. Learn more: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/geGXT7Qq?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/geGXT7Qq</a></p>
